{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "New Challenges"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Aesthetically Pleasing"}, {"type": "position", "content": 5}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 9}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.3"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe the reasons or results of events or actions in spoken or written texts, in work and social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn11le09ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "aesthetically pleasing"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "pleasant to look at"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: As far as I'm concerned, the illustrations just aren't that aesthetically pleasing."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le09ob05aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when talking about layouts and illustrations."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "balance"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a condition in which different elements are equal or in the correct proportions"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Because there isn't a balance on the page."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le09ob05aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "visuals"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "pictures of graphics used to illustrate or accompany something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The visuals are all wrong."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le09ob05aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "white space"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "portion of a page left unmarked"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There is too much white space on the page."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le09ob05aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "darkened"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "make or become dark or darker"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What I think needs to be happen is for them to be darkened."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le09ob05aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "contour lines"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "lines which define a form or an edge"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm convinced that these contour lines aren't well defined."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le09ob05aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "typeface"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the \u200bstyle and \u200bsize of the \u200bprinted \u200bletters used in a \u200bnewspaper, \u200bbook, \u200bdocument"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm of the opinion that this typeface has got to be changed."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le09ob05aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "counters"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the enclosed or partially enclosed circular or curved negative space (white space) of some letters such as d, o"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The counters should be rounded and open, not angular or rectangular."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le09ob05aud08"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Reason Clauses"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you want to be more precise about the reason for things, you can use linking words to introduce reason clauses."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Refer to the chart for a summary of different words/phrases you can use with reason clauses and their meanings."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Word/Phrase\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning/Use\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"because\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the most common conjunction. It answers the question <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Why?</span> <br/> <br/>can come at the beginning of the sentence, or in between the two clauses\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Because</span> there isn't a balance between the visuals and the white space on the page, it comes off looking not so appealing. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"since\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"introduces a reason that the listener is already familiar with\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Since</span> there is a lot of white space on the page, they don't pop out. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"now that\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"used in very formal or literary contexts\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Now that</span> we're done with that, we can schedule a meeting with the illustrator. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Verbs and Structures to Express Opinion"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can use certain phrases and structures to express your opinion in a variety of ways. Expressing yourself in a polite and clear way is an important part of business conduct."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Here are some effective phrases you can use to express your opinion:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">I'm convinced that ... <br/>I'm of the opinion that ... <br/>As far as I'm concerned, ... <br/>To my way of thinking, ... <br/>What I think is that \u2026</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:<br/><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">As far as I'm concerned</span>, the illustrations just aren't that aesthetically pleasing. </span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm convinced that these <span class=\"strong\">contour lines</span> aren't well defined and therefore, not as noticeable. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "What I think needs to be happen is for them to be <span class=\"strong\">darkened</span>."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm convinced that's the case. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm of the opinion that this <span class=\"strong\">typeface</span> has got to be changed. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "To my way of thinking, the text should be larger. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I think we should avoid the all caps."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go online and find 5 different images of objects. These images must be vague and taken from an angle that doesn't show the entire object. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Go to a website like Playbuzz for ideas about the types of images you should get. Do not choose only these images. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Save the chosen images on your phone/ computer or print them out."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Show the pictures to your class."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Discuss what you think the images are and explain why you think that."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I go online to find vague images."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I save the images to show my class."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I present the images to my class."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I discuss what the images represent."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I explain my reasons."}]}], "labs": [{"type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "exercises": [{"type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [0], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Le